                  <div id=3D"023.003">
                     <p class=3D"oj-normal">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Dessutom sk=
a f=C3=B6ljande uppgifter, i&nbsp;till=C3=A4mpliga fall och om de =C3=A4r t=
illg=C3=A4ngliga, genast =C3=B6verf=C3=B6ras till Eurodac i&nbsp;enlighet m=
ed artikel&nbsp;3.2:</p>
                     <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" c=
ellpadding=3D"0">
                        <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                        <col width=3D"96%">
                        </colgroup><tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">a)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">I enlighet med punk=
t&nbsp;6 i&nbsp;den h=C3=A4r artikeln, det datum d=C3=A5 den ber=C3=B6rda p=
ersonen l=C3=A4mnade eller avl=C3=A4gsnades fr=C3=A5n medlemsstaternas terr=
itorium.</p>
                              </td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                     <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" c=
ellpadding=3D"0">
                        <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                        <col width=3D"96%">
                        </colgroup><tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">b)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">Omf=C3=B6rdelningsm=
edlemsstaten i&nbsp;enlighet med artikel&nbsp;25.1.</p>
                              </td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                     <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" c=
ellpadding=3D"0">
                        <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                        <col width=3D"96%">
                        </colgroup><tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">c)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">Om till=C3=A4mpligt=
, i&nbsp;de fall som avses i&nbsp;artikel&nbsp;25.2, datumet f=C3=B6r perso=
nens inresa efter genomf=C3=B6rd =C3=B6verf=C3=B6ring.</p>
                              </td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                     <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" c=
ellpadding=3D"0">
                        <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                        <col width=3D"96%">
                        </colgroup><tbody>
                           <tr>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">d)</p>
                              </td>
                              <td valign=3D"top">
                                 <p class=3D"oj-normal">Uppgift om att st=
=C3=B6d till frivilligt =C3=A5terv=C3=A4ndande och =C3=A5teranpassning har =
beviljats.</p>
                              </td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
